{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S09把“想在难受时有人陪”强化成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，心理动机显得比Y更武断，Y保留了更细腻的暧昧。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点加亮和话语、感受交替，让观众更容易抓住每段叙事转折；感受按音乐进程出现，也避免了Y在S03等短时段把大量短词同时堆在屏幕上的问题。X对音乐的节奏、音色、织体和人物身体反应描写更具体，反复出现的舞曲、旧歌和摇篮曲也让前后形成呼应；但Y的完整叙述在解释人物动机时偶尔更准确、更克制。综合实际观看体验，X更容易让普通观众边听边读，既跟住故事，也感受到音乐与心理变化的细节。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dedd5a15-1800-4f15-b7a4-173184cd1e9b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T183020779780Z", "elapsed_seconds": 92.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:31:53.664088+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c9e39c32441fc926edb4860d62b6636349d42e7ce21cf5ed7cc9a622b909fa6e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\